                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The only Bomberman clone on Steam so far that gets it even close to being right. Unfortunately this isn't nearly ambitious or inspired enough, and they cut corners everywhere from recolored monsters, barely remixed public domain classical music, shared AI, and minimal Bomberman and Super Bomberman mechanics. However, it's still a fun and it's competent at what it does copy and the bosses are challenging if not cheaty at times. Online is also, naturally, dead if you don't have a friend/s ready to play with you. \n\nIt's just a shame they didn't put real effort into the game to make it truly great.  Still, it'll do in the meantime if you want more of a classic NES bomberman that only shares a few things from Super Bomberman like spiked bombs and trigger bombs instead of interesting levels and rideable creatures.",
